msgid "Noise Modeling {#noise-modeling}"
msgstr "Pemodelan Hingar {#noise-modeling}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A noise model describes how errors affect the results from executing a quantum circuit. Noise models support several stages of a typical workflow including: simulating a circuit classically to estimate expected performance before submitting a job  or to inform an error-mitigation technique such as probabilistic error cancellation. For general strategies to reduce the impact of noise during execution, see [Overview of noise management techniques](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"
msgstr "Model hingar menerangkan bagaimana ralat menjejaskan hasil daripada pelaksanaan litar kuantum. Model hingar menyokong beberapa peringkat aliran kerja biasa termasuk: mensimulasikan litar secara klasik untuk menganggarkan prestasi yang dijangkakan sebelum menghantar kerja atau untuk memaklumkan teknik pengurangan ralat seperti pembatalan ralat kebarangkalian. Untuk strategi umum bagi mengurangkan kesan hingar semasa pelaksanaan, lihat [Gambaran keseluruhan teknik pengurusan hingar](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page collects the packages and capabilities that support each part of that workflow, grouped into learning noise from a device, building a noise model for classical simulation, and refining a noise model for a specific error-mitigation technique.\n"
msgstr "Halaman ini mengumpulkan pakej dan keupayaan yang menyokong setiap bahagian aliran kerja itu, dikelompokkan kepada mempelajari hingar daripada peranti, membina model hingar untuk simulasi klasik, dan memperhalus model hingar untuk teknik pengurangan ralat tertentu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building and running noise learning algorithms {#building-and-running-noise-learning-algorithms}"
msgstr "Membina dan menjalankan algoritma pembelajaran hingar {#building-and-running-noise-learning-algorithms}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use noise learning packages to characterize a device's noise directly from experimental data. These packages run randomized circuits to estimate error rates and build a noise model that reflects actual hardware behavior.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan pakej pembelajaran hingar untuk mencirikan hingar peranti terus daripada data eksperimen. Pakej ini menjalankan litar rawak untuk menganggarkan kadar ralat dan membina model hingar yang mencerminkan tingkah laku perkakasan sebenar.\n"

